    {
      "id": "2a5ae103612b",
      "source": "FBX, OBJ, ABC Import",
      "target": "FBX、OBJ、ABC 导入",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c827c78a7d0",
      "source": "Embergen can import models and animations from other 3d packages to be used as emitters, colliders, or as holdout objects for your renders.",
      "target": "EmberGen 可以从其他 3D 软件包导入模型和动画，用作渲染中的发射器、碰撞体或遮挡对象。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "407f1a0626e3",
      "source": "This can be done using the ",
      "target": "这可以通过 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6838f42d9d79",
      "source": "Import",
      "target": "Import",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "88e04af68d05",
      "source": " node.",
      "target": " 节点完成。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "57bb16cf1891",
      "source": "You can browse for your file from the ",
      "target": "可以在 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dec5b5e6f32c",
      "source": "Asset",
      "target": "Asset",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "27ebceea3ceb",
      "source": " tab.",
      "target": " 选项卡中浏览并选择文件。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "89896aa13992",
      "source": "We primarily support the FBX file format but you can also use OBJ or ABC files.",
      "target": "我们主要支持 FBX 文件格式，但也可以使用 OBJ 或 ABC 文件。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6425771d8021",
      "source": "For Alembic, only the OGAWA format is supported!",
      "target": "对于 Alembic，仅支持 OGAWA 格式！",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0905672661a1",
      "source": "You will want to store these files locally. If you are loading your imported mesh from a network drive this can cause instability in simulations and renders.",
      "target": "建议将这些文件存放在本地。如果从网络驱动器加载导入的网格，可能会导致模拟和渲染不稳定。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ae7372de9753",
      "source": "It could be that your models show up way too small or way too big. Then you should go to the ",
      "target": "导入模型可能显示得过小或过大。此时应转到 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d4fc54bfc30c",
      "source": "Transform",
      "target": "Transform",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a03ea4c53c94",
      "source": " tab and find the ",
      "target": " 选项卡，找到 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0e827ae83ae5",
      "source": "Scale and center to fit",
      "target": "Scale and center to fit",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "feb7ec6821ab",
      "source": " button. This should position and scale your imported models nicely withing the Embergen scene. If this somehow doesn’t work as desired, find the ",
      "target": " 按钮。这应该会把导入模型正确定位并缩放到 EmberGen 场景中。如果仍未达到预期，可找到 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b74dd3980f37",
      "source": "Master Scale",
      "target": "Master Scale",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "16b49e6f26c8",
      "source": " parameter to rescale your import to better fit the Embergen scene. The ",
      "target": " 参数，重新缩放导入内容，使其更适合 EmberGen 场景。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "927cd32e99df",
      "source": "Scale",
      "target": "Scale",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "056f02984a06",
      "source": " parameter can be used to fine-tune your scaling.",
      "target": " 参数可用于微调缩放。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d17a63cc9520",
      "source": "The ",
      "target": "该 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5339193a8813",
      "source": "Geometry",
      "target": "Geometry",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "91bdec9cf4d6",
      "source": " output pin can be connected to the ",
      "target": " 输出引脚可以连接到 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "65747ea4049c",
      "source": "Shapes",
      "target": "Shapes",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "37854fd3f6b2",
      "source": " input pin on an ",
      "target": " 输入引脚，该输入引脚位于 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a513db9cff90",
      "source": "Emitter",
      "target": "Emitter",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cfead9456c61",
      "source": " node or a ",
      "target": " 节点或 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4115a7e3a4c6",
      "source": "Collider",
      "target": "Collider",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3f0c7fa38feb",
      "source": " node.",
      "target": " 节点。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b2ae67e9d5d8",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e9ccd6620f2",
      "source": "You can separate models or even parts of models out using the ",
      "target": "可以使用 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "be99ada1e639",
      "source": "Mask",
      "target": "Mask",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bf764d45005f",
      "source": " outputs.",
      "target": " 输出分离模型，甚至分离模型的一部分。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7ba9a2d0587f",
      "source": "These masks each have their own tab where you can specify what you need to be masked by picking a mesh from the list, a specific set of bones or a vertex color.",
      "target": "这些遮罩各自都有自己的选项卡，你可以在其中从列表选择网格、指定骨骼集或顶点颜色，来指定需要被遮罩的内容。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0d26ffec268b",
      "source": "The ",
      "target": "这些 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a514213ac04e",
      "source": "Mask",
      "target": "Mask",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "11398b93cfd7",
      "source": " output pins will only output the shapes specified in that mask.",
      "target": " 输出引脚只会输出该遮罩中指定的形状。",
      "note": ""
    },
